{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Zen 是一款離線習慣追蹤工具，適合想建立新習慣或戒除舊習的人使用。每個習慣、日子與筆記只存放在 iPhone 的本機資料庫，毋須帳戶，也沒有廣告、追蹤或訂閱。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>四種目標與習慣強度</h2>\n<p>提供四種目標：計時、計次、分回合完成，以及戒除類目標。可從 236 個預設習慣與 16 個分類開始，或自行撰寫並設定重複日子、提醒與圖示。習慣強度把紀錄換算成 0 至 100 分，配合連續日數查看。度假、生病或休息期間提醒會暫停，缺席日子略過而不中斷連續紀錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Zen: Habits &amp; Accountability</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T12:40:35.074164+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}